		{
			dependencies: ["11B8EF9631422774"]
			description: [
				"The red planet hides more than dust and stone. Scattered across Mars lie relics of a fallen civilization, each guarding secrets of &cfire, spirit, and steel&r. To master the Martian Flame, you must unravel three trials—sanctuary, forge, and altar—each deadlier than the last."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"⛩ &6Martian Temples&r"
				"Shadows of a Lost Faith"
				""
				"Simple ruins scattered across the surface, the &6Martian Temples&r offer fragments of a forgotten culture. Their halls contain a little loot—&osmall treasures&r left behind in dusty chests—but no great challenge."
				"Yet they mark the path to something far greater, guiding explorers toward the trials that lie deeper within Mars."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"🔥 &cSoul Blacksmith&r"
				"Relics of a Forgotten Forge"
				""
				"Amid scorched cliffs rises the &4Soul Blacksmith&r—&lforged in flame&r and protected by ruthless defenders."
				"Here, the ancients shaped &opowerful relics&r and &crare artifacts&r, binding steel to soul. Yet the forge itself is alive: traps, guardians, and echoes of war wait within."
				"Conquer the Blacksmith, and you carry the key to the altar."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"🩸 &4Infernal Altar&r"
				"The Gateway to the Inferno"
				""
				"On Mars lies the &4Infernal Altar&r, its heart lit by eternal fire. A mysterious tome rests upon the lectern, its faded script whispering the ancient rite:"
				""
				"“To summon the &cINFERNO&r, stand firm in flame."
				"A warrior must be worthy of strength."
				"Only then may they endure this blazing terror’s ire.”"
				""
				"To awaken the guardian, a &fNether Star&r must be offered. Drop it onto the lectern, and from the fire rises the &cHovering Inferno&r—the final trial, a blazing terror of relentless fury."
				"Defeat it, and the Martian Flame itself will bend to your will."
			]
