		{
			dependencies: ["598BD03BE0D0347B"]
			description: [
				"⛏ &cRedstone Riches: Mining the Depths of Mars&r"
				""
				"Mars is far more than a lifeless desert—&lit’s a planet of hidden potential&r, waiting to be unearthed by those bold enough to dig deep."
				""
				"Beneath its crimson surface lies a cache of &6rare materials&r, each vital to your continued progression. Discover &fStellaris&r, a mysterious celestial metal with untapped power. Mine &dMars Ostrum Ore&r, a crucial ingredient for crafting high-tier components. Unearth &bMars Ice Shard Ore&r, a frozen enigma that could hold the key to survival in extreme environments."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lGear up&r and establish a forward mining base—&oyou'll need it&r. Mars is as hostile as it is rich, and the creatures lurking in its caves don’t take kindly to trespassers."
				""
				"&lWill you brave the depths and emerge with riches—or be buried beneath the red dust?&r"
			]
