				"Your mission on Mars has tested your resolve and rewarded your ambition. But in the grand expanse of the cosmos, &othis is only the beginning&r."
				""
				"Armed with &6rare Martian resources&r and the wisdom of ancient ruins, it’s time to set your sights on the next frontier: &cMercury&r—&la world of blazing heat, volatile terrain, and secrets long buried beneath scorched stone&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe path forward will not be easy.&r Mercury offers &ounique opportunities and lethal hazards&r in equal measure. You’ll need upgraded tech, advanced protection, and an unshakable will to thrive."
